hadiths[53]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1396","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sawar paidal ko salam kare, paidal baithe ko, kam zyada ko."
"1397","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Musalman ka Musalman par paanch haq hain: Salam ka jawab dena, beemar ki ayadat, janazon ke peechhe chalna, dawat qubool karna, chheenkne wale ko jawab dena."
"1398","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhe Ahle Kitab salam karein to kaho: Wa alaikum."
"1399","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhe Yahood salam karein to un mein se ek kehta hai: Tum par maut ho. Phir kaho: Aur tum par."
"1400","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yahood mein se ek giroh Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dakhil hua. Phir unhon ne kaha: Tum par maut ho. Phir main use samjhi. Phir main ne kaha: Tum par maut aur lanat ho. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Thehro ae Aisha! Kyunke Allah har mamle mein narmi pasand farmata hai. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum ne nahi suna jo unhon ne kaha? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne kaha: Aur tum par."
"1401","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo bachchon ke paas se guzre aur unhe salam kiya. Aur farmaya: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aisa karte they."
"1402","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sauda parda farz hone ke baad apni hajat ke liye niklein. Aur wo bhari jism wali aurat thein jo use pehchante us se chhupi na rehti thein. Phir Umar bin al-Khattab ne unhe dekha. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Sauda! Allah ki qasam! Tum hum se nahi chhupteen. Phir dekho kaise nikalti ho? Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo laut kar phir gayein jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere ghar mein they. Aur Wo raat ka khana kha rahe they, Aap ke hath mein haddi thi. Phir wo dakhil huein. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main apni kuchh hajat ke liye nikli. Phir Umar ne mujh se aisa aur aisa kaha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Allah ne Aap par wahi nazil farmayi. Phir Aap se uthayi gayi jabke haddi Aap ke hath mein thi, use nahi rakha tha. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumhe ijazat di gayi hai ke tum apni hajat ke liye niklo."
"1403","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aurton ke paas dakhil hone se bacho. Phir Ansar mein se ek mard ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Dewar ke bare mein batayiye? Aap ne farmaya: Dewar maut hai."
"1404","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Safiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas Aap se mulaqat ke liye aayein, Aap ke i'tikaf mein, masjid mein, Ramazan ke aakhri ashre mein. Phir Aap ke paas kuchh der baat ki. Phir khadi huein aur lautne lagein. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke sath unhe lautane khade hue. Yahan tak ke jab masjid ke darwaze pahunchein, Umm Salama ke darwaze ke paas, Ansar mein se do mard guzre. Phir unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko salam kiya. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un dono se farmaya: Thehro. Beshak ye Safiyya bint Huyayy hain. To un dono ne kaha: SubhanAllah, Ya Rasulullah! Aur un par bhari guzra. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak shaitan insan mein khoon ki jagah pahunchta hai. Aur beshak mujhe dar hua ke wo tumhare dilon mein koi cheez dale."
"1405","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Waqid al-Laithi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab masjid mein baithe they jabke log Aap ke sath they, to teen afrad aaye. Phir do Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf aaye aur ek chala gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo dono Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par khade hue. Raha un mein se ek, us ne halqe mein kushadgi dekhi. Phir us mein baitha. Aur raha doosra, wo un ke peechhe baitha. Aur raha teesra, wo peeth pher kar chala gaya. Phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farigh hue to farmaya: Kya main tumhe teen afrad ke bare mein khabar na dun? Raha un mein se ek, wo Allah ki taraf aaya to Allah ne use panah di. Aur raha doosra, wo sharmaya to Allah us se sharmaya. Aur raha doosra, us ne munh phera to Allah ne us se munh phera."
"1406","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi aadmi ko us ki majlis se na uthaye phir us mein baithe."
"1407","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke mere paas mukhannas tha. Phir usے Abdullah bin Umayya se kehte suna: Ae Abdullah! Batayo, agar Allah kal tum par Taif fatah kare to tum par Ghailan ki beti lazim hai. Kyunke wo chaar se aage badhti hai aur aath se peechhe hatti hai. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye tum par dakhil na hon."
"1408","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Zubair ne nikah kiya jabke zameen mein un ka maal, ghulam aur koi cheez na thi, siwaye pani dhone wale oont aur us ke ghode ke. Phir main us ke ghode ko chara deti, pani pilati, us ki mashk seeti, aata gundhti. Aur main roti pakana achhi tarah nahi janti thi. Aur Ansar mein se meri padosan aurtein pakati thein, jabke wo sachi aurtein thein. Aur main Zubair ki zameen se guthliyan uthakar lati jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe qata karke di thi, apne sar par, jo mujh se do tihayi farsakh par thi. Phir ek din aayi jabke guthliyan mere sar par thein. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mili jabke Aap ke sath Ansar mein se ek jamaat thi. Phir Aap ne mujhe bulaya. Phir farmaya: Ikh ikh, taake mujhe apne peechhe sawar karein. Phir main mardon ke sath chalne se sharmayi. Aur Zubair aur us ki ghairat ko yaad kiya, jabke wo logon mein sab se ghairat wale they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne pehchana ke main sharmayi. Phir Aap aage badhe. Phir main Zubair ke paas aayi. Phir main ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mile jabke mere sar par guthliyan thein, jabke Aap ke sath Aap ke sathiyon mein se ek jamaat thi. Phir Aap ne sawari bithayi taake main sawar hun. Phir main Aap se sharmayi. Aur tumhari ghairat ko pehchana. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tumhara guthliyan uthana mujh par tumhare us ke sath sawar hone se zyada bhari tha. Unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke Abu Bakr ne is ke baad mere paas khadim bheja jo mujhe ghode ki dekh-bhaal mein kafi ho. Phir goya us ne mujhe aazad kiya."
"1409","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne farmaya: Jab teen hon to do teesre ke siwa sargoshi na karein."
"1410","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum teen ho to do shakhs doosre ke siwa sargoshi na karein yahan tak ke logon se mil jao, is liye ke use ghamgeen kare."
"1411","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Nazar haq hai."
"1412","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par jadu kiya gaya. Yahan tak ke Wo dekhte ke Wo aurton ke paas aate jabke Wo un ke paas na aate. Sufyan ne kaha [sanad ke ek rawi]: Aur ye sab se sakht hai jo jadu mein hota hai jab aisa ho. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Kya tumhe ilm hai ke Allah ne mujhe us mein fatwa diya jis mein main ne Aap se fatwa manga? Mere paas do mard aaye. Phir un mein se ek mere sar ke paas baitha, doosra mere paon ke paas. Phir jo mere sar ke paas tha us ne doosre se kaha: Shakhs ka kya haal hai? Us ne kaha: Jadu kiya gaya. Us ne kaha: Aur use kis ne jadu kiya? Us ne kaha: Lubaid bin A'sam, jo Zuraiq mein se ek mard hai, Yahood ka halif, munafiq tha. Us ne kaha: Aur kis mein? Us ne kaha: Kanghi aur baalon mein. Us ne kaha: Aur kahan? Us ne kaha: Nar khajoor ke khol mein, kunwein ki mundher ke neeche, Dharwan ke kunwein mein. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kunwein ke paas aaye yahan tak ke use nikala. Phir farmaya: Ye wo kunwan hai jo mujhe dikhaya gaya tha. Aur goya us ka pani mehndi ke pani jaisa tha. Aur goya us ke khajoor shaitanon ke saron jaisa they. Unhon ne kaha: Phir use nikala gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne kaha: Kya tum, matlab, dam na karoge? To Aap ne farmaya: Suno! Allah ki qasam! Us ne mujhe shifa di hai. Aur main na-pasand karta hun ke logon mein se kisi par shar ubharun."
"1413","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek Yahoodi aurat Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas zeher-aalood bakri lekar aayi. Phir Aap ne us mein se khaya. Phir wo layi gayi. Phir kaha gaya: Kya hum use qatl na karein? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke halaq mein pehchanta raha."
"1414","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab beemar ke paas aate ya Aap ke paas laya jata to farmate: Takleef door farma, logon ke Rab! Shifa de jabke Tu shifa dene wala hai. Teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi. Aisi shifa jo beemari nahi chhorti."
"1415","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab beemar hote to apne aap par mu'awwidhat parh kar dam farmate aur phoonkte. Phir jab Aap ka dard sakht hua to main Aap par parhti aur Aap ke hath se masah karti, us ki barkat ki ummeed mein."
"1416","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Aswad bin Yazid ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha se bukhar se dam ke bare mein poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne har zeher wale se dam ki ijazat di."
"1417","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) beemar se farmate: Allah ke naam se. Hamari zameen ki mitti, hum mein se ek ke luaab se. Hamara beemar shifa pata hai, hamare Rab ki ijazat se."
"1418","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe hukm farmaya, ya hukm diya ke nazar se dam kiya jaye."
"1419","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke ghar mein londi dekhi jis ke chehre mein zardi thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Us ke liye dam karo. Kyunke use nazar hai."
"1420","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se ek jamaat safar mein nikli jo unhon ne kiya. Yahan tak ke Arab ke qabeelon mein se ek qabeelay par utre. Phir unhon ne un se mehmaani mangi. Phir unhon ne un ki mehmaani se inkar kiya. Phir us qabeelay ke sardar ko bichchhu ne kaata. Phir us ke liye har cheez se koshish ki jo use faida na de. Phir un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Kash tum in giroh ke paas aate jo utre hain. Shayad un mein se ek ke paas koi cheez ho. Phir wo un ke paas aaye. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ae giroh! Beshak hamara sardar kaata gaya hai. Aur hum ne us ke liye har cheez se koshish ki jo use faida nahi deti. To kya tum mein se kisi ke paas kuchh hai? Phir un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Haan, Allah ki qasam! Beshak main dam karta hun. Lekin Allah ki qasam! Hum ne tum se mehmaani mangi to tum ne hamari mehmaani na ki. Phir main tumhe dam karne wala nahi yahan tak ke tum hamare liye ujrat rakho. Phir unhon ne un se bakriyon ke rewad par sulah ki. Phir wo thookte hue chala aur parhta [tamam tareef Allah ke liye jo jahano ka Rab hai]. Phir goya aqal se khol diya gaya. Phir chalne laga jabke use dil ki beemari na thi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne unhe un ki ujrat poori di jis par unhon ne un se sulah ki thi. Phir un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Taqseem karo. Phir jis ne dam kiya us ne kaha: Aisa na karo yahan tak ke hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayein. Phir Aap se wo zikr karein jo tha. Phir hum dekhein Aap hamein kya hukm farmate hain. Phir wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Phir Aap se zikr kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe kya maloom ke wo dam hai? Phir farmaya: Tum ne durust paya. Taqseem karo aur mere liye tumhare sath hissa rakho. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hanse."
"1421","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Agar tumhari dawaiyon mein se kisi cheez mein, ya tumhari dawaiyon mein se kisi cheez mein bhalayi ho to seengi ke cheer mein, ya shehed ke sharbat mein, ya aag se daghne mein jo beemari ke muwafiq ho. Aur main pasand nahi karta ke dagha jayun."
"1422","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne seengi lagwayi aur seengi lagane wale ko us ki ujrat di."
"1423","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) seengi lagwate, aur kisi ki ujrat mein zulm na farmate."
"1424","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bukhar Jahannam ki lapak se hai. Phir use pani se thanda karo."
"1425","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab un ke paas bukhar wali aurat layi jati to wo us ke liye dua karteen. Pani letin aur use us ke aur us ke gireban ke darmiyan dalteen. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamein hukm farmate ke hum use pani se thanda karein."
"1426","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Bukhar Jahannam ki bhadak se hai. Phir use pani se thanda karo."
"1427","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Aap ko Aap ki bimari mein munh mein dawa pilayi. Phir Wo hamari taraf ishara karne lage ke mujhe munh mein dawa na pilao. Phir hum ne kaha: Beemar ka dawa se nafrat karna. Phir jab Aap hosh mein aaye to farmaya: Kya main ne tumhe mana nahi farmaya ke mujhe munh mein dawa pilao? Hum ne kaha: Beemar ka dawa se nafrat karna. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Ghar mein koi na rehne paye magar munh mein dawa pilaya jaye jabke main dekhta hun, siwaye Abbas ke. Kyunke wo tum mein hazir na they."
"1428","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Qais bint Mihsan (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo apne chhote bete ko jo khana nahi khata tha, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas layein. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use apni god mein bithaya. Phir us ne Aap ke kapde par peshab kar diya. Phir Aap ne pani mangwaya aur us par chhente mare aur use dhoya nahi."
"1429","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Qais bint Mihsan (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Tum par ye Hindi lakdi lazim hai. Kyunke us mein saat shifa hain. Us se gala padne se naak mein dali jati hai, aur seenay ke dard se munh mein pilayi jati hai."
"1430","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Kalonji mein har beemari se shifa hai, siwaye maut ke."
"1431","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo jab un ke ghar walon mein se maiyat mar jati, phir is ke liye aurtein jama hotin, phir muntashir ho jatin siwaye un ke ghar walon aur khason ke, to wo talbeena ki handi ka hukm detin. Phir pakayi jati. Phir sareed banaya jata. Phir talbeena us par undeli jati. Phir kehtin: Us mein se khayiye. Kyunke main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Talbeena beemar ke dil ko sukoon deta hai. Kuchh gham door karta hai."
"1432","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Mera bhai pet ki shikayat karta hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Use shehed pilao. Phir doosri martaba aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use shehed pilao. Phir teesri martaba Aap ke paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use shehed pilao. Phir Aap ke paas aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Main ne kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne sach farmaya aur tumhare bhai ka pet jhoota hua. Use shehed pilao. Phir us ne use pilaya. Phir wo theek ho gaya."
"1433","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ta'oon napaki hai. Bani Israil ke ek giroh par bheji gayi, ya tum se pehle walon par. Phir jab tum use zameen mein suno to us par na aao. Aur jab wo zameen mein waqe ho jabke tum us mein ho to us se bhag kar na niklo [aur ek riwayat mein]: Tumhe sirf us se bhagna nikale."
"1434","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abd al-Rahman bin Auf se Abdullah bin Abbas ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) Sham ki taraf nikle. Yahan tak ke jab Sargh mein they to unhe lashkaron ke ameer Abu Ubaida bin al-Jarrah aur un ke sathi mile. Phir unhon ne unhe khabar di ke waba Sham ki zameen mein waqe hui hai. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Phir Umar ne kaha: Mere liye pehle Muhajirin ko bulao. Phir unhon ne unhe bulaya. Phir un se mashwara kiya aur unhe khabar di ke waba Sham mein waqe hui hai. Phir unhon ne ikhtilaf kiya. Phir un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Tum ek mamle ke liye nikle ho. Aur hum nahi dekhte ke tum us se lauto. Aur un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Tumhare sath logon ke baqi aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba hain. Aur hum nahi dekhte ke tum unhe is waba par pesh karo. To unhon ne kaha: Mujh se uth jao. Phir kaha: Mere liye Ansar ko bulao. Phir main ne unhe bulaya. Phir un se mashwara kiya. Phir wo Muhajirin ke raste par chale. Aur un ke ikhtilaf jaisa ikhtilaf kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Mujh se uth jao. Phir kaha: Mere liye unhe bulao jo yahan Quraish ke budhon mein se Fatah ki hijrat wale hain. Phir main ne unhe bulaya. Phir un mein se do mard bhi un par ikhtilaf na karte. Phir unhon ne kaha: Hum dekhte hain ke tum logon ke sath lauto aur unhe is waba par pesh na karo. Phir Umar ne logon mein pukara: Beshak main subah sawari par hun. Phir subah us par ho jao. Abu Ubaida bin al-Jarrah ne kaha: Kya Allah ki taqdeer se bhagna? Phir Umar ne kaha: Kash tumhare siwa kehta ae Abu Ubaida! Haan. Hum Allah ki taqdeer se Allah ki taqdeer ki taraf bhagte hain. Batayo, agar tumhare paas oont hon jo wadi mein utre jis ke do kinare hon, ek sarsabz ek khushk. Kya jab tum sarsabz charao to use Allah ki taqdeer se charao. Aur jab khushk charao to use Allah ki taqdeer se charao? Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abd al-Rahman bin Auf aaye jabke wo apni kuchh hajat mein ghayab they. Phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak mere paas is mein ilm hai. Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jab tum use zameen mein suno to us par na aao. Aur jab wo zameen mein waqe ho jabke tum us mein ho to us se bhag kar na niklo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Umar ne Allah ki hamd ki. Phir phire."
"1435","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Chhoot nahi, safar nahi, hamah nahi. Phir ek dehati ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Phir mere oonton ka kya haal hai jo ret mein hiranon jaisa hote hain? Phir khujli wala oont aata hai aur un ke darmiyan dakhil hota hai aur unhe khujli lagata hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Phir pehle ko kis ne lagayi?"
"1436","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beemar sehat-mand par na laye jayein."
"1437","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Chhoot nahi, bad-faali nahi. Aur mujhe nek shagun pasand hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur nek shagun kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Achhi baat."
"1438","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Bad-faali nahi. Aur us ka behtar nek shagun hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur nek shagun kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nek kalima jo tum mein se ek sunta hai."
"1439","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Chhoot nahi, bad-faali nahi. Aur manhoosiyat teen mein hai: Aurat, ghar aur sawari mein."
"1440","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Agar kisi cheez mein ho to aurat, ghode aur maskan mein]."
"1441","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar aur Abu Lubaba (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko mimbar par khutba dete suna, Aap farmate: [Saanpon ko qatl karo. Aur do dhariyon wale aur dum-kate ko qatl karo. Kyunke wo nazar zaya karte hain aur hamal gira dete hain]. Abdullah ne kaha: Phir jab main saanp ka peechha kar raha tha taake use qatl karun to Abu Lubaba ne mujhe pukara: Use na qatl karo. Phir main ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne saanpon ke qatl ka hukm farmaya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak Aap ne is ke baad gharon walon se mana farmaya, jo aane waliyan hain. Aur ek riwayat mein: Phir mujhe Abu Lubaba bin Abd al-Mundhir, ya Zaid bin al-Khattab ne dekha."
"1442","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ghaar mein they to Aap par ye nazil hui: [Aur bheji hui hawaoon ki qasam]. Phir hum ne use Aap ke munh se li, jabke Aap ka munh us se tar tha. Jab saanp nikla. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: [Tum par lazim hai, use qatl karo]. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum us ki taraf daud पड़े aur wo hum se aage badh gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne farmaya: [Wo tumhare shar se bachaya gaya jaisa tum us ke shar se bachaye gaye]."
"1443","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Sharik (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe chipkaliyan qatl karne ka hukm farmaya."
"1444","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chipkali ke bare mein farmaya: Chhota fasiq. Aur main ne Aap ko use qatl karne ka hukm farmate nahi suna."
"1445","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Chiunti ne Ambiya mein se ek Nabi ko kaata. Phir unhon ne chiuntiyon ki basti ko jalane ka hukm diya. Phir use jala diya gaya. Phir Allah ne un ki taraf wahi farmayi ke tumhe chiunti ne kaata aur tum ne tasbeeh karne wali ummaton mein se ek ummat ko jala diya."
"1446","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ek aurat ko billi mein azab diya gaya jisے us ne qaid kiya yahan tak ke wo mar gayi. Phir wo us mein Aag mein dakhil hui. Na us ne use khilaya na pilaya jab use qaid kiya. Na us ne use chhora ke wo zameen ke keede khaye."
"1447","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi chalta hua pyas se sakht hua. Phir kunwein mein utra. Phir us mein se piya. Phir nikla. Phir wo kutte se tha jo pyas se mitti khata hua hanp raha tha. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak ye us ko pahunchا hai jo mujhe pahuncha tha. Phir us ne apna moza bhara. Phir use apne munh se pakda. Phir chadha. Phir kutte ko pilaya. Phir Allah ne us ka shukr ada kiya aur use bakhsh diya. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya beshak hamare liye janwaron mein ajr hai? Aap ne farmaya: Har tar jigar mein ajr hai."
"1448","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab kutta kunwein ke ird-gird ghoom raha tha jabke use pyas qatl karne wali thi, to use Bani Israil ki zaniyon mein se zaniya ne dekha. Phir us ne apna moza utaara. Phir use pilaya. Phir us se usے bakhsh diya gaya."
